# For builds whose context is the repository root (web/Dockerfile: the screens
# import depth/core, so the context has to hold both). Everything a root-context
# image never copies stays on the host — otherwise every dependency tree and
# every worktree under .claude travelled to the daemon on each build.
*
!depth/core
!depth/ink/locales
!web
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/e2e/node_modules
web/e2e/results
